ng Primary Categories from complex string trees for segmented analysis.\n","\n","*  Calculating Discount Depth to analyze promotional impact.\n","\n","\n","*  Noise Reduction: Handling missing values in rating and description to prevent skewed averages.\n","\n","\n","\n","\n","\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"WIEbURyECAZE"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# **TASK 3: Advanced Visual Intelligence (10+ Charts)**\n","\n","We transitioned from basic counts to multi-dimensional distributions using a consistent **Dark-Mode (Black-Box)** aesthetic:\n","\n","\n","\n","*   Univariate Mapping: Price Distribution (Histograms) and Category Volume (Bar Charts).\n","\n","*  Bivariate Exploration: JointPlots (KDE) to map price-rating density and Lollipop Charts for category performance ranking.\n","  \n","*  Multivariate Discovery: Violin Plots and Interactive Treemaps to visualize price spread across different business departments simultaneously.\n","\n","\n","*  Segmented Insights: Facet Grids to observe how individual categories react to pricing shifts.\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"wq2C6O8LR68H"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["# **TASK 4: Strategic Synthesis & Business Insights**\n","The final phase converts visual patterns into 5 critical business pillars:\n","\n","\n","\n","*   Value-for-Money Identification: Pinpointing the exact price bracket where customer satisfaction peaks (The Mid-Range Tier).\n","\n","* Category Performance Audit: Ranking segments by average rating to identify \"At-Risk\" categories requiring quality intervention.\n","\n","*   Pricing Elasticity: Analyzing if higher price points correlate with higher ratings in specific functional categories.\n","\n","* Inventory Depth Analysis: Visualizing catalog concentration to identify \"Over-Stocked\" vs. \"Under-Served\" niches.\n","\n","\n","\n","* Operational Recommendations: Providing a tiered pricing strategy based on observed category density.\n","\n","\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"pM4dppy6T7Kf"}},{"cell_ty